    "biography": "<p>These tiny devilish creatures are red or black in skin color with cat-like eyes, long pointed tails and bat-wings. They are the lowliest of demons and often serve as slaves to greater demons or servants of powerful evil clerics and magic-users. Imps are immune to non-magical weapons and fire and can cast Detect Magic at will and Invisibility once per day&mdash;both as a magic-user. Their tail has a moderately powerful poison which can kill if a saving throw is not successful, though the victim receives a +4 bonus to their roll.</p>",
